OL,3,GNEWSACalls for better hospital
OL,4,Atransport
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome islanders have called for better
OL,7,Ftransport services to and from hospital
OL,8,Fin Jersey.
OL,10,FJohn Heys, who lives alone aged 88, was
OL,11,Frecently in hospital for a few days
OL,12,Fwith a broken ankle.
OL,14,FHe said it was "an absolute disgrace"
OL,15,Fhe was not offered transport home
OL,16,Ffollowing his stay, as he could not
OL,17,Fwalk and ended up having to take a
OL,18,Ftaxi, which he said was difficult to
OL,19,Fget in and out of.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
