OL,3,GNEWSACalls for better hospital
OL,4,Atransport
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth and Care Jersey said eligibility
OL,7,Ffor the non-emergency patient transport
OL,8,Fservice was "determined by a clinician,
OL,9,Fbased on patient's needs and individual
OL,10,Fcircumstances".
